  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: 23e9e932-a566-4225-9420-1dafe96e5d26
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • Total profit of $286K represents only 12.5% margin on $2.3M revenue
        • High cost structure consuming 87.5% of total sales revenue
        • Revenue generation strong but profit conversion efficiency low

        Recommendations:
        • Analyze cost structure by category to identify reduction opportunities
        • Focus on higher-margin products and customer segments
        • Implement pricing optimization to improve profit margins
